  ; CHECK-NEXT:   [[BUILD_VECTOR:%[0-9]+]]:_(<4 x i32>) = G_BUILD_VECTOR [[UV]](i32), [[UV1]](i32), [[UV2]](i32), [[UV3]](i32)
